   "title": "Logo in Motion",
   "date": 2025,
   "description": "For this assignment, we were tasked with recreating a logo with motion, challenging us to add transitions and enhanced movements to existing elements. By combining both visual and audio cues, I created a simple yet effective animation that communicates the brand identity and purpose",
