 {
   "slug": "depaul-orientation-2026",
   "title": "2026 DePaul Orientation Leader Introduction",
   "date": 2026,
   "description": "As a graphic designer and photographer for DePaul University, I was asked to create a minute-long video shown to incoming freshmen at summer orientations that introduces each leader (30 in total). By communicating with a videographer about shot compositions and timing, I was able to effectively mask footage of the leaders onto shots of the campus, as well as do some additional color editing and finally, add the typography and transitions.",
   "category": "2d-motion-graphics",
   "sub-folder": "",
