 {
   "slug": "premiere-film-festival",
   "title": "Premiere Film Festival",
   "date": 2026,
   "description": "I was paired with two other students to create a poster for the Annual DePaul Premiere Film Festival. We decided on a theme reminiscent of the red carpet and the Grammy’s, settling on a red and gold color scheme and abstract shapes that could create interesting motion. By choosing a thinner type,with accents and placing the text in a composition that aligned with the visual elements, we were able to effectively communicate the information required while also creating an eye-catching advertisement.",
   "category": "3d-motion-graphics",
   "sub-folder": "Premiere Film Festival",
