 {
   "slug": "crewlicks-album-cover",
   "title": "Crewlicks Album Cover",
   "date": 2026,
   "description": "This was a final created in my graphic design class, where I was challenged to create an album cover for an artist and genre I knew nothing about. Through research and experimentation, I was able to capture the style of the band, Dead Rider, using visual depictions of how they describe their music, as mentioned by the group’s main vocalist and founder, “I like stacking it up and then taking out one too many blocks.”",
   "category": "graphic-design",
