 {
   "slug": "conecopia-ice-cream",
   "title": "ConeCopia Ice Cream Brand",
   "date": 2026,
   "description": "As an assignment from my typography class, I mocked up the design, type, and patterns of an ice cream brand. Through a process of critiques and feedback from classmates, I decided to make the final type into a playful style, using rounder shapes and bright colors. The brand, named “Conecopia”, specializes in cone flavors, allowing customers to experiment with mixing and matching ice cream with their cones depending on their tastes.",
   "category": "graphic-design",
   "sub-folder": "ConeCopia Ice Cream Brand",
